L215:   < 0.001) in both groups over the 10‐week intervention, with no differences in the extent of decline between groups (see Figure  3d,g,h,i , respectively). Vitamin D metabolite ratios (25(OH)D 3 :24,25(OH) 2 D 3  and 1,25(OH) 2 D 3 :24,25(OH) 2 D 3 ) increased over the winter in both groups (both  p t 
