L219: In the subgroup of participants completing assessment of vitamin D expenditure (control group  n  = 11, exercise group  n  = 14), there were no changes in d 3 ‐25(OH)D 3  half‐life in plasma over the intervention in either group ( p t 
L220:   = 0.86 and  p x 
