L644:  
L645:  ]  (see below), where Free 25(OH)D = concentration of free 25(OH) vitamin D in mol/L;  K 
L646:  alb  = affinity constant between 25(OH) vitamin D and albumin in mol/L;  K 
L647:  DBP  = affinity constant between 25(OH)D vitamin D and DBP in mol/L; albumin = concentration of total serum albumin in mol/L; DBP = concentration of total vitamin D‐binding protein in mol/L (assuming a MW of 58 000 g mole −1 ); Total 25(OH) vitamin D = concentration of total 25(OHD in mol/L).
L648:  
L649:  (1) 
L650:  Free 25 O H D = total 25 O H D 1 + K a l b × albumin + K D B P × D B P
