L664: As a biomarker for whole body 25(OH)D3 expenditure, disappearance rate of d 3 ‐25(OH)D 3  stable isotope tracer in plasma was used to estimated half‐life using the line of best fit of the natural log of d 3 ‐25(OH)D 3  concentration against time. [ 
L665:  
